{"result":"{
  "id": "19191",
  "key": "SFCC-742",
  "summary": "Wishlist – Login Panel Content",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/19191",
  "description": "As a Developer,\n I want a `wishlist-login-panel` content component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \nso that it renders the authentication prompt inside the `pdp/drawer` (SFCC-736) when a logged-out shopper attempts to add an item to their wishlist.\n\n----\n\nThe component covers the panel content only — the drawer shell, slide-in behaviour, overlay, and close trigger are owned by `pdp/drawer` (SFCC-736). This component renders as children passed into that shell.\n\nThe panel content comprises three sections separated by dividers:\n\n1. Email / OTP section — explanatory copy, email input field, and Send Code CTA\n1. Social sign-in section — Sign in with Apple and Sign in with Google buttons\n1. New account section — New to Zimmermann? heading, supporting copy, and Create an Account CTA\n\nAuthentication logic and API integration are out of scope for this story and are covered in the relevant auth stories.\n\n|Prop| |Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|size|Large, Small, Mobile|Controls layout variant| |",
  "status": {
    "name": "In Progress",
    "category": "In Progress",
    "color": "yellow"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "High"
